# Generated simulation output is reproducible from a seed (Rules.md #6) --
# don't commit full runs. A small, real sample run stays committed under
# output/sample/ so the output shape is inspectable without re-running
# anything (Architecture.md: "gitignored except a small committed sample").
output/*
!output/sample/
!output/sample/**

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
